        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-4">
        <div class="card h-100">
            <div class="card-header"><strong>🏷️ 任务类别分布</strong></div>
            <div class="card-body">
                <div class="mb-3">
                    <div class="d-flex justify-content-between mb-1">
                        <span>Code Generation</span>
